  "description": "Lightweight form builder for Umbraco 16, 17 and 18 - create, manage, and render dynamic forms from the backoffice. Supports 19+ field types, groups/columns layout, client-side validation, sensitive data encryption, multi-language, and custom field extensibility. Runs on SQL Server, SQLite and PostgreSQL.",
